{"3716440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PROJECT: Melee Only", "steam_appid": 3716440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start low, be a menace later</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >start at a random generated stage, defeat every enemy, repeat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >break through the highest stage possible and start over stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/23a6054d7a9fc5e980a8a4e9868f162b.poster.avif?t=1782575161\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/23a6054d7a9fc5e980a8a4e9868f162b.webm?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/23a6054d7a9fc5e980a8a4e9868f162b.mp4?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death is temporary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You keep your Level, EXP and Souls after death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAM can be spent in your skill-tree where you can choose which stat to boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CPU can unlock active abilities, your power supply can upgrade your battery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/3da9e4964307f7c317dc109a16e5b043.poster.avif?t=1782575161\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/3da9e4964307f7c317dc109a16e5b043.webm?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/3da9e4964307f7c317dc109a16e5b043.mp4?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slash or deflect to dominate the map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're restricted to a melee weapon, but you can redirect enemy bullets back to their owner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/2a8eb80b6dac6e08d4a51d3a12daba53.poster.avif?t=1782575161\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/2a8eb80b6dac6e08d4a51d3a12daba53.webm?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/2a8eb80b6dac6e08d4a51d3a12daba53.mp4?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start low, be a menace later</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >start at a random generated stage, defeat every enemy, repeat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >break through the highest stage possible and start over stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/23a6054d7a9fc5e980a8a4e9868f162b.poster.avif?t=1782575161\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/23a6054d7a9fc5e980a8a4e9868f162b.webm?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/23a6054d7a9fc5e980a8a4e9868f162b.mp4?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death is temporary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You keep your Level, EXP and Souls after death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAM can be spent in your skill-tree where you can choose which stat to boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CPU can unlock active abilities, your power supply can upgrade your battery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/3da9e4964307f7c317dc109a16e5b043.poster.avif?t=1782575161\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/3da9e4964307f7c317dc109a16e5b043.webm?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/3da9e4964307f7c317dc109a16e5b043.mp4?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slash or deflect to dominate the map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're restricted to a melee weapon, but you can redirect enemy bullets back to their owner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/2a8eb80b6dac6e08d4a51d3a12daba53.poster.avif?t=1782575161\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/2a8eb80b6dac6e08d4a51d3a12daba53.webm?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716440/extras/2a8eb80b6dac6e08d4a51d3a12daba53.mp4?t=1782575161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Play as an Android and fight your way to the highest Stage possible. Keep your level and your EXP and start again stronger. Reveal the secret of your purpo